<title>HONG KONG: Hong Kong Ferry 1996 profit down 58 pct.</title>
<headline>Hong Kong Ferry 1996 profit down 58 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-03-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   42.3    vs 99.9</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    29.0    vs 29.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  Nil     vs 266.5 gain</p>
<p>    Net			    150.7   vs 355.8</p>
<p>    Turnover		     1,279.7 vs 1,172.9</p>
<p>    Company name		 Hong Kong Ferry (Holdings) Co Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  April 15-18</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   April 18</p>
<p>NOTE - Hong Kong Ferry is involved in ferry operations, trading, property investment and the travel business.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is 37 H.K. cents (including interim dividend of eight cents) vs 37 cents.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
